==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro}} ''[[lunatique]]'', from {{etyl|LL.}} ''[[lunaticus]]'' ("moonstruck"), derived from {{etyl|la}} ''[[luna]]'' ("moon").

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[insane]] person.

====Synonyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:mad person]]

